     "text": "{\"reachable\": true, \"rationale\": \"Both entry footholds, edge0:reach and edge1:reach, start out reachable. h1_1:access is an OR step and edge0:reach is one of its parents, so it is reachable. h2_1:reach is an OR step and h1_1:access is one of its parents, so it is reachable without the blocked h1_2:obtain. h3_0:access is an OR step and h2_1:reach is one of its parents, so it is reachable (h1_0:reach, from edge1:reach, also works). crown:obtain is an OR step and h3_0:access is one of its parents, so the target is reachable. h3_2:reach is also reachable through h1_1:access. Only h3_1:reach is cut off, because it is an AND step that needs the blocked h2_0:escalate.\"}"
